1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:04,587
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:05,422 --> 00:00:06,673
[gunshots]

3
00:00:06,756 --> 00:00:07,966
[gun clicks, fires]

4
00:00:09,426 --> 00:00:10,677
[whoosh, slashing sounds]

5
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,679
[machine gun fire]

6
00:00:12,762 --> 00:00:14,681
[machine gun fire continues]

7
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:15,765
[single gunshot]

8
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:19,853
[rapid gunfire]

9
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:22,397
[echoing blast]

10
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,107
[rapid gunfire]

11
00:00:24,858 --> 00:00:25,942
[blade whooshing]

12
00:00:26,025 --> 00:00:28,445
[tense music builds]

13
00:00:28,528 --> 00:00:29,696
[blade whooshing]

14
00:00:32,615 --> 00:00:37,912
<i>I shed blood, sweat, and tears</i>
<i>to establish Poblacion Ardiente.</i>

15
00:00:37,996 --> 00:00:41,458
<i>So, blood, sweat, and tears</i>
<i>will spill over</i>

16
00:00:41,541 --> 00:00:43,501
<i>the land they took from me.</i>

17
00:00:43,585 --> 00:00:45,503
[Camia] <i>I do hope this is the end</i>

18
00:00:45,587 --> 00:00:48,131
<i>and not the beginning</i>
<i>of an even bigger battle.</i>

19
00:00:48,214 --> 00:00:49,466
<i>If they come back,</i>

20
00:00:49,549 --> 00:00:52,218
<i>I'll make sure</i>
<i>to take everything they have,</i>

21
00:00:52,302 --> 00:00:55,597
<i>so they can pay for all their crimes.</i>

22
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:59,267
[Diego] <i>We will wipe away</i>
<i>all the filth left in our town.</i>

23
00:00:59,350 --> 00:01:03,271
<i>Then, we will create a new</i>
<i>Poblacion Ardiente together!</i>

24
00:01:03,354 --> 00:01:04,522
[crowd] <i>Diego! Diego!</i>

25
00:01:04,606 --> 00:01:07,484
-[gunshots]
-[crowd shrieking]

26
00:01:11,488 --> 00:01:12,530
<i>Diego.</i>

27
00:01:15,033 --> 00:01:16,659
[Emilia] <i>Where do we go now, Papa?</i>

28
00:01:16,743 --> 00:01:19,496
<i>Everyone hates us.</i>
<i>We've got nowhere to run.</i>

29
00:01:19,579 --> 00:01:22,665
[Julio] <i>Just drive.</i>
<i>I already know where to go.</i>

30
00:01:24,709 --> 00:01:28,296
<i>Diego! Diego… </i>[sobbing]

31
00:01:28,379 --> 00:01:30,757
<i>He's gone. Diego's gone.</i>

32
00:01:31,716 --> 00:01:34,219
[tense music playing]

33
00:01:43,436 --> 00:01:45,522
[somber music playing]

34
00:01:53,488 --> 00:01:54,531
[exhales]

35
00:01:55,198 --> 00:01:56,991
I'll stay here for a while, Mom.

36
00:01:59,327 --> 00:02:00,620
Are you sure, dear?

37
00:02:03,832 --> 00:02:05,542
[breathes deeply]

38
00:02:05,625 --> 00:02:06,668
All right.

39
00:02:08,128 --> 00:02:10,088
[somber music playing]

40
00:02:19,889 --> 00:02:20,974
[door closes]

41
00:02:21,975 --> 00:02:24,060
[somber music playing]

42
00:02:47,250 --> 00:02:49,252
[somber music playing]

43
00:02:57,719 --> 00:02:58,887
[exhales]

44
00:02:58,970 --> 00:03:01,139
[somber music playing]

45
00:03:18,615 --> 00:03:19,699
[sniffles]

46
00:03:22,619 --> 00:03:24,162
[sobbing]

47
00:03:40,887 --> 00:03:42,430
[Diego] <i>Let's enjoy the night.</i>

48
00:03:42,972 --> 00:03:44,515
<i>Because first thing tomorrow,</i>

49
00:03:45,058 --> 00:03:47,769
<i>we'll continue working towards our dream</i>

50
00:03:47,852 --> 00:03:51,439
<i>of having a peaceful and happy town.</i>

51
00:03:51,981 --> 00:03:56,527
<i>We will live in Ardiente.</i>
<i>We'll raise our children here.</i>

52
00:03:56,903 --> 00:03:58,863
<i>We'll start a family here.</i>

53
00:03:59,239 --> 00:04:02,325
<i>Your dream is my dream too.</i>

54
00:04:02,659 --> 00:04:07,455
<i>Remember, Diego.</i>
<i>It's you and me. Till the end.</i>

55
00:04:08,581 --> 00:04:10,708
[somber music playing]

56
00:04:17,465 --> 00:04:18,633
[sobbing]

57
00:04:30,395 --> 00:04:32,188
[sobbing]

58
00:04:49,497 --> 00:04:55,128
-[sentimental music playing]
-[sobbing]

59
00:05:09,309 --> 00:05:14,397
-[sentimental music playing]
-[sobbing]

60
00:05:27,994 --> 00:05:29,746
[Diego] <i>Even though I've left this world…</i>

61
00:05:31,706 --> 00:05:34,167
<i>I'll always be in your heart.</i>

62
00:05:36,377 --> 00:05:38,171
<i>I'll watch over you…</i>

63
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:42,842
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" playing]

64
00:06:06,783 --> 00:06:09,660
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" continues playing]

65
00:06:36,979 --> 00:06:40,149
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" instrumental playing]

66
00:06:52,370 --> 00:06:54,163
Diego. [sobbing]

67
00:06:55,748 --> 00:06:56,958
Diego.

68
00:06:57,542 --> 00:07:00,545
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" instrumental playing]

69
00:07:01,462 --> 00:07:04,549
[sobbing]

70
00:07:18,938 --> 00:07:20,606
[tense music playing]

71
00:07:24,694 --> 00:07:26,571
You can stay here while in hiding.

72
00:07:26,821 --> 00:07:28,072
You'll be safe.

73
00:07:28,364 --> 00:07:30,950
Mr. dela Torre will see you
as soon as he gets here.

74
00:07:31,033 --> 00:07:33,119
He's with the Triad leaders in Korea.

75
00:07:33,786 --> 00:07:37,206
Thank you for helping us.
If not for you, we are doomed.

76
00:07:37,290 --> 00:07:39,375
You can thank your father for calling us.

77
00:07:39,459 --> 00:07:40,668
You're the daughter of Red Dragon.

78
00:07:40,751 --> 00:07:43,463
You're one of us.
And the Triad is here to help.

79
00:07:43,546 --> 00:07:44,881
[tense music playing]

80
00:07:56,434 --> 00:07:57,518
[sighs]

81
00:07:58,978 --> 00:07:59,979
[exhales sharply]

82
00:08:02,690 --> 00:08:03,733
[groans]

83
00:08:09,780 --> 00:08:10,698
Papa?

84
00:08:16,204 --> 00:08:18,080
[breathes deeply]

85
00:08:20,791 --> 00:08:22,627
<i>The shocking video</i>
<i>of Lily Cruz's public torture</i>

86
00:08:22,710 --> 00:08:24,629
<i>has finally been released.</i>

87
00:08:24,712 --> 00:08:26,380
[woman] <i>They hid that video for so long.</i>

88
00:08:26,464 --> 00:08:28,591
<i>It wouldn't have been made public</i>

89
00:08:28,674 --> 00:08:30,676
<i>if it weren't for Governor Diego's death.</i>

90
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:33,679
<i>The Ardientes are cruel to the bone!</i>

91
00:08:33,763 --> 00:08:35,181
<i>We want justice!</i>

92
00:08:35,264 --> 00:08:37,141
<i>We apologize to our viewers.</i>

93
00:08:37,225 --> 00:08:39,644
<i>Here's a portion of the gruesome video.</i>

94
00:08:40,394 --> 00:08:42,104
[clamoring]

95
00:08:45,483 --> 00:08:48,778
<i>We condemn the actions</i>
<i>of Governor Julio Ardiente.</i>

96
00:08:48,861 --> 00:08:52,198
<i>It's sad that these kinds</i>
<i>of actions are still happening.</i>

97
00:08:52,281 --> 00:08:55,117
<i>What they did is cruel. They're monsters.</i>

98
00:08:56,661 --> 00:08:57,745
<i>This is barbaric.</i>

99
00:08:57,828 --> 00:09:01,541
<i>No public official can act</i>
<i>as an executioner.</i>

100
00:09:01,624 --> 00:09:03,584
<i>This should've followed due process.</i>

101
00:09:03,668 --> 00:09:06,295
[Julianna] <i>The Ardientes took</i>
<i>the law into their hands.</i>

102
00:09:06,379 --> 00:09:08,839
<i>This act of cruelty must stop now.</i>

103
00:09:08,923 --> 00:09:11,509
<i>Public officials are obligated</i>
<i>to protect human rights.</i>

104
00:09:11,592 --> 00:09:13,844
<i>Arrest the Ardientes!</i>

105
00:09:13,928 --> 00:09:16,138
<i>They don't deserve their positions!</i>

106
00:09:16,222 --> 00:09:18,391
<i>We will hunt you down.</i>

107
00:09:18,474 --> 00:09:21,143
[tense music playing]

108
00:09:42,748 --> 00:09:45,126
[tense music playing]

109
00:09:52,049 --> 00:09:55,928
[crowd cheering]

110
00:09:56,178 --> 00:09:58,055
<i>Viva Ardiente!</i>

111
00:09:58,431 --> 00:10:03,728
<i>-Viva Ardiente!</i>
<i>-Viva Ardiente!</i>

112
00:10:03,811 --> 00:10:05,980
[crowd cheering]

113
00:10:07,231 --> 00:10:09,525
[tense music playing]

114
00:10:13,571 --> 00:10:14,822
Is this it?!

115
00:10:15,865 --> 00:10:20,036
Is this the punishment you're giving me?!

116
00:10:21,078 --> 00:10:24,206
Yes, I killed a lot of people!

117
00:10:25,166 --> 00:10:26,959
I made them all suffer!

118
00:10:28,419 --> 00:10:31,339
But they all deserved to die

119
00:10:31,797 --> 00:10:36,260
because they can be considered
the scums of the earth!

120
00:10:36,719 --> 00:10:42,141
I was just trying to help you
make this godforsaken province

121
00:10:42,224 --> 00:10:44,977
a better place to live in!

122
00:10:45,227 --> 00:10:46,437
[breathes deeply]

123
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:51,651
I was getting rid
of the worthless bastards

124
00:10:51,734 --> 00:10:53,611
in this world.

125
00:10:55,738 --> 00:10:56,947
And I…

126
00:10:57,323 --> 00:11:03,079
If I have to do it all over again…

127
00:11:06,707 --> 00:11:08,709
-[canes clatter]
-Yes, I would do it!

128
00:11:09,335 --> 00:11:10,419
Because I…

129
00:11:11,295 --> 00:11:13,756
I am Julio Ardiente!

130
00:11:15,508 --> 00:11:17,760
And if anyone goes against me,

131
00:11:18,761 --> 00:11:21,680
I'll send them back to you
with a bullet in their head!

132
00:11:23,224 --> 00:11:24,642
Do you hear me?!

133
00:11:26,394 --> 00:11:28,229
Punish me if you want!

134
00:11:32,441 --> 00:11:38,447
I was just trying
to make this a better place!

135
00:11:40,616 --> 00:11:42,034
Don't you see?!

136
00:11:43,953 --> 00:11:47,164
Those people I killed were worse than me!

137
00:11:49,625 --> 00:11:52,962
They were far worse than me!

138
00:11:54,338 --> 00:11:55,589
[sobbing]

139
00:11:56,966 --> 00:11:59,385
[breathes deeply]

140
00:12:05,516 --> 00:12:08,102
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
by Joey Ayala playing]

141
00:12:32,084 --> 00:12:36,380
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
continues playing]

142
00:12:55,816 --> 00:12:58,027
NEW ARDIENTE

143
00:12:58,110 --> 00:13:02,823
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
continues playing]

144
00:13:17,046 --> 00:13:20,466
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
continues playing]

145
00:13:27,515 --> 00:13:31,101
[Lily] <i>My journey has led me</i>
<i>into the darkness,</i>

146
00:13:31,685 --> 00:13:33,771
<i>so I could see the light.</i>

147
00:13:34,563 --> 00:13:37,858
<i>The darkness in Diego's death,</i>

148
00:13:38,442 --> 00:13:42,238
<i>and suffering in the hands</i>
<i>of the Ardientes.</i>

149
00:13:43,948 --> 00:13:46,242
[Diego] <i>We'll make our dreams come true.</i>

150
00:13:46,951 --> 00:13:48,244
<i>You and me,</i>

151
00:13:49,119 --> 00:13:52,623
<i>we'll rebuild Poblacion Ardiente.</i>

152
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:54,708
<i>You are my life, Diego.</i>

153
00:13:57,545 --> 00:13:59,296
<i>You are my governor.</i>

154
00:14:01,882 --> 00:14:04,426
<i>You are the governor of this province.</i>

155
00:14:04,677 --> 00:14:06,095
<i>I love you so much.</i>

156
00:14:07,388 --> 00:14:09,348
<i>I love you so much too, Diego.</i>

157
00:14:10,641 --> 00:14:13,269
[soft guitar music playing]

158
00:14:20,526 --> 00:14:22,236
<i>I am your wife.</i>

159
00:14:23,696 --> 00:14:27,241
<i>But this town is your mother.</i>

160
00:14:28,742 --> 00:14:31,120
<i>I'm not the only one who loves you,</i>

161
00:14:31,954 --> 00:14:34,415
<i>but the people as well.</i>

162
00:14:35,165 --> 00:14:40,629
<i>And I promise to love this town</i>

163
00:14:40,921 --> 00:14:45,634
<i>like how you loved the people of Ardiente.</i>

164
00:14:46,427 --> 00:14:48,971
<i>A love like the one I have for you.</i>

165
00:14:50,681 --> 00:14:52,057
<i>Never-ending.</i>

166
00:14:52,808 --> 00:14:55,436
<i>Eternal.</i>

167
00:14:56,604 --> 00:15:00,190
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
by Joey Ayala playing]

168
00:15:12,369 --> 00:15:15,539
[dramatic music playing]

169
00:15:59,750 --> 00:16:01,460
<i>Goodbye, Diego.</i>

170
00:16:02,169 --> 00:16:04,046
[dramatic music playing]

171
00:16:08,175 --> 00:16:10,052
<i>I love you so much.</i>

172
00:16:17,267 --> 00:16:19,395
[unsettling music playing]

173
00:16:24,483 --> 00:16:25,484
[Julio] Hmm.

174
00:16:25,567 --> 00:16:27,152
[sighs] Papa.

175
00:16:27,611 --> 00:16:30,781
Don't worry about that human rights group.

176
00:16:30,864 --> 00:16:32,491
You know, they just love to bark.

177
00:16:32,574 --> 00:16:35,369
But they can't bite us. So, don't worry.

178
00:16:35,744 --> 00:16:39,206
Because when Stefano comes,
the Triad will help us.

179
00:16:40,958 --> 00:16:44,294
I like your fighting spirit.

180
00:16:46,588 --> 00:16:50,092
Actually, I'm glad
you're finally displaying

181
00:16:50,175 --> 00:16:52,761
the heart of a true Ardiente.

182
00:16:53,929 --> 00:16:56,432
You know, if you remember…

183
00:16:58,350 --> 00:17:00,602
only the weak…

184
00:17:02,896 --> 00:17:05,399
can be conquered by fear.

185
00:17:06,483 --> 00:17:10,529
And we'll never be weak.

186
00:17:10,612 --> 00:17:12,740
[reporter] <i>Hundreds of people</i>
<i>have been continuously coming</i>

187
00:17:12,823 --> 00:17:15,117
<i>to take part in the hero's</i>
<i>burial of the People's Governor</i>

188
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:17,369
<i>of Poblacion Ardiente, Diego Torillo.</i>

189
00:17:17,453 --> 00:17:20,789
<i>We can clearly see</i>
<i>the unity of the whole town.</i>

190
00:17:26,712 --> 00:17:28,255
Those ingrates!

191
00:17:29,506 --> 00:17:30,549
[Julio scoffs]

192
00:17:31,216 --> 00:17:35,929
Who gave them the right
to have a parade of that…

193
00:17:37,639 --> 00:17:41,977
that bastard's corpse?

194
00:17:42,603 --> 00:17:43,562
Huh?

195
00:17:43,937 --> 00:17:45,939
That animal has no right to be governor!

196
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:51,361
No right! I'm the only one
who has the right

197
00:17:51,445 --> 00:17:54,615
to be the governor of Poblacion Ardiente!

198
00:17:57,326 --> 00:17:59,036
I'm the only king!

199
00:18:00,079 --> 00:18:02,873
I am the only king!

200
00:18:03,957 --> 00:18:06,835
And no one else can claim my crown.

201
00:18:07,127 --> 00:18:08,212
All of you…

202
00:18:08,796 --> 00:18:11,757
You're just a bunch of good-for-nothings!

203
00:18:11,840 --> 00:18:13,592
-[thuds]
-[glass shattering]

204
00:18:13,675 --> 00:18:15,761
[clapping] Go, Papa!

205
00:18:15,844 --> 00:18:19,056
Show them that you are the one
and only king of Ardiente!

206
00:18:19,139 --> 00:18:20,265
I am!

207
00:18:21,350 --> 00:18:26,396
I am the only king of Ardiente!
No one else!

208
00:18:27,815 --> 00:18:29,900
-Yes.
-Definitely not…

209
00:18:31,026 --> 00:18:33,403
that dead bastard.

210
00:18:33,987 --> 00:18:35,864
[tense music playing]

211
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:50,003
[somber music playing]

212
00:19:08,105 --> 00:19:09,231
Lily.

213
00:19:22,703 --> 00:19:24,788
I know very well how you're feeling.

214
00:19:29,001 --> 00:19:31,628
I also felt that
when your dad passed away.

215
00:19:32,379 --> 00:19:35,757
[young Lily] <i>Mom, you haven't</i>
<i>gone to work for weeks.</i>

216
00:19:35,841 --> 00:19:37,968
<i>What's going to happen to us now?</i>

217
00:19:38,218 --> 00:19:39,553
[shouts] <i>I don't know!</i>

218
00:19:39,636 --> 00:19:44,057
-[sobbing]
-<i>Please don't cry.</i>

219
00:19:46,226 --> 00:19:47,978
<i>Mom. Please don't cry.</i>

220
00:19:49,354 --> 00:19:51,190
[Camia] <i>But you took care of me…</i>

221
00:19:53,192 --> 00:19:55,402
even when I lost myself.

222
00:19:58,113 --> 00:19:59,531
Lily, remember…

223
00:20:01,658 --> 00:20:03,827
I'll never abandon you.

224
00:20:05,078 --> 00:20:08,081
Don't let the hatred consume your heart.

225
00:20:09,458 --> 00:20:12,961
Don't be like the people who killed Diego.

226
00:20:14,171 --> 00:20:17,049
No matter how grave their crime was…

227
00:20:21,345 --> 00:20:24,640
that doesn't give you the right
to take their lives.

228
00:20:28,518 --> 00:20:30,771
They're the ones who had no right.

229
00:20:33,941 --> 00:20:37,903
They had no right to take
Diego away from me.

230
00:20:37,986 --> 00:20:39,154
None!

231
00:20:42,324 --> 00:20:44,243
They took away my life.

232
00:20:46,995 --> 00:20:52,292
So, not even their deaths
would be punishment enough

233
00:20:52,376 --> 00:20:54,544
for what they did to Diego.

234
00:20:56,088 --> 00:20:57,965
[tense music playing]

235
00:21:08,183 --> 00:21:10,811
[waves crashing]

236
00:21:29,371 --> 00:21:32,165
[tense music playing]

237
00:21:41,800 --> 00:21:44,261
[tense music playing]

238
00:21:55,272 --> 00:21:57,482
[camera shutter clicks]

239
00:21:57,566 --> 00:21:59,818
[tense music playing]

240
00:22:13,957 --> 00:22:15,625
-[Emilia] <i>Auntie!</i>
-[gunshot]

241
00:22:15,709 --> 00:22:16,626
[Emilia] <i>No!</i>

242
00:22:16,877 --> 00:22:19,338
[screams] <i>Auntie!</i>

243
00:22:22,674 --> 00:22:23,759
[gunshot]

244
00:22:23,842 --> 00:22:26,011
[suspenseful music playing]

245
00:22:26,970 --> 00:22:31,641
[screaming, wailing]

246
00:22:35,979 --> 00:22:39,608
-[explosion]
-<i>Mama!</i>

247
00:22:39,691 --> 00:22:41,234
[suspenseful music playing]

248
00:22:59,544 --> 00:23:02,672
<i>Be strong, Emilia. Your Papa needs you.</i>

249
00:23:04,424 --> 00:23:07,385
<i>We'll take back everything</i>
<i>that was stolen from us.</i>

250
00:23:07,469 --> 00:23:09,179
[tense music playing]

251
00:23:17,562 --> 00:23:18,605
Papa?

252
00:23:19,272 --> 00:23:20,482
[Julio] Mm?

253
00:23:20,565 --> 00:23:21,858
-[soft thud]
-[clicks tongue]

254
00:23:22,400 --> 00:23:24,694
It's time to celebrate.

255
00:23:25,320 --> 00:23:29,407
Do you know that
I was just talking to Stefano?

256
00:23:30,659 --> 00:23:32,661
-And he's coming.
-Wow.

257
00:23:32,744 --> 00:23:37,874
And he's bringing with him a whole army

258
00:23:37,958 --> 00:23:44,214
that we can use to attack
the people who drove us away.

259
00:23:46,716 --> 00:23:49,094
If I can't have my province back,

260
00:23:49,928 --> 00:23:53,932
I will make sure
that no one else can have it.

261
00:23:56,476 --> 00:24:00,897
The lands of Ardiente
will run red with blood.

262
00:24:01,648 --> 00:24:02,649
Perfect, Papa.

263
00:24:03,316 --> 00:24:05,569
Give them the punishment
that they deserve.

264
00:24:05,652 --> 00:24:09,656
Oh, they will get the punishment
that they deserve.

265
00:24:09,739 --> 00:24:14,035
And we will get back
what is rightfully ours.

266
00:24:17,330 --> 00:24:18,456
You and me.

267
00:24:19,416 --> 00:24:23,420
We'll be the ones who'll carry on running

268
00:24:23,503 --> 00:24:25,797
your mother's syndicate.

269
00:24:29,009 --> 00:24:31,636
And the people of Ardiente

270
00:24:31,720 --> 00:24:33,638
won't be the only ones kneeling before us.

271
00:24:35,849 --> 00:24:37,267
Even you.

272
00:24:37,976 --> 00:24:40,187
Because I'm coming for you.

273
00:24:40,937 --> 00:24:41,938
[chuckles]

274
00:24:42,022 --> 00:24:43,732
[tense music playing]

275
00:24:46,818 --> 00:24:49,487
[ominous music playing]

276
00:24:58,371 --> 00:25:00,040
[no audible dialogue]

277
00:25:00,123 --> 00:25:02,125
[ominous music playing]

278
00:25:10,258 --> 00:25:11,551
[no audible dialogue]

279
00:25:11,635 --> 00:25:14,304
[tense music playing]

280
00:25:30,904 --> 00:25:32,822
-Emilia.
-Stefano.

281
00:25:32,906 --> 00:25:35,367
-And Governor Ardiente.
-Hey, Stefano.

282
00:25:35,659 --> 00:25:37,202
-[chuckles]
-Welcome, welcome.

283
00:25:37,702 --> 00:25:42,499
Just a little token of appreciation…

284
00:25:44,167 --> 00:25:48,713
for being able to grace
this lovely afternoon

285
00:25:48,797 --> 00:25:50,048
with your presence.

286
00:25:52,842 --> 00:25:54,010
Now this…

287
00:25:54,094 --> 00:25:56,137
[loads rifle]

288
00:25:56,930 --> 00:25:59,641
This is the kind of weapon…

289
00:26:01,851 --> 00:26:05,814
…that will basically turn
any enemy into dust.

290
00:26:05,897 --> 00:26:07,065
[loads rifle]

291
00:26:08,191 --> 00:26:13,822
This is payback for all who
disrespected the administration

292
00:26:13,905 --> 00:26:17,617
that fed them and their families.

293
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:20,954
I may have fallen,

294
00:26:21,037 --> 00:26:25,458
but like the legendary bird, the phoenix,

295
00:26:25,542 --> 00:26:28,586
I shall once again rise from the ashes.

296
00:26:28,920 --> 00:26:32,882
More beautiful, more powerful than ever.

297
00:26:34,676 --> 00:26:39,806
And everyone who disrespected my name…

298
00:26:40,348 --> 00:26:42,976
will fall on their knees.

299
00:26:45,937 --> 00:26:47,272
Watch out!

300
00:26:48,273 --> 00:26:52,694
I'm coming back, your Señor Julio.

301
00:26:53,278 --> 00:26:58,199
All hail the return of the king.

302
00:26:59,242 --> 00:27:00,410
And of course…

303
00:27:01,453 --> 00:27:04,956
with my queen of Poblacion Ardiente…

304
00:27:06,333 --> 00:27:09,711
-my very own Emilia.
-[Emilia chuckles]

305
00:27:12,088 --> 00:27:12,964
[Stefano] Then…

306
00:27:15,550 --> 00:27:19,179
The alliance between the Triad

307
00:27:19,262 --> 00:27:22,265
and the Ardiente family is now official.

308
00:27:22,349 --> 00:27:23,641
-Mm-hm.
-[Julio] Good.

309
00:27:23,725 --> 00:27:25,143
It has been decided…

310
00:27:26,644 --> 00:27:30,398
that the new leader of this organization

311
00:27:31,274 --> 00:27:32,400
is none other than…

312
00:27:36,446 --> 00:27:37,947
Emilia Ardiente.

313
00:27:38,448 --> 00:27:41,409
I swear I wasn't expecting this, Papa.

314
00:27:41,493 --> 00:27:44,079
[laughs] Thank you.

315
00:27:44,662 --> 00:27:47,165
Mama Red Dragon, I love you.

316
00:27:47,248 --> 00:27:49,167
Thank you for the trust and the chance

317
00:27:49,250 --> 00:27:50,835
that you've given me with this job.

318
00:27:50,919 --> 00:27:55,090
I promise that I'm going
to do good and… thank you.

319
00:27:55,173 --> 00:27:56,966
I love you, Mama. I love you.

320
00:27:58,301 --> 00:28:00,303
-And to you, Papa.
-Yes?

321
00:28:00,887 --> 00:28:01,888
[chuckles softly]

322
00:28:02,722 --> 00:28:03,640
Pa…

323
00:28:04,182 --> 00:28:09,229
I know we talked about
running this syndicate together.

324
00:28:09,938 --> 00:28:11,773
Now that they gave this to me,

325
00:28:12,816 --> 00:28:16,653
I promise to run this
the same way you would have.

326
00:28:17,445 --> 00:28:20,115
I hope you're proud of me, Papa.

327
00:28:20,198 --> 00:28:22,325
[clicks tongue] Of course.

328
00:28:22,951 --> 00:28:24,911
I am very proud of you, Emilia.

329
00:28:25,495 --> 00:28:28,581
Very, very proud.

330
00:28:29,958 --> 00:28:31,167
Thank you, Papa.

331
00:28:32,001 --> 00:28:33,086
[Emilia sighs]

332
00:28:33,837 --> 00:28:35,672
Let's not waste any time!

333
00:28:37,590 --> 00:28:41,094
We will march to Poblacion Ardiente,

334
00:28:41,177 --> 00:28:44,806
and we will take the town
back to Ardiente!

335
00:28:44,889 --> 00:28:48,518
Because Ardiente is for the Ardientes!

336
00:28:49,394 --> 00:28:52,939
-Viva Ardiente!
-Viva Ardiente!

337
00:28:53,148 --> 00:28:57,026
-Viva Ardiente!
-Viva Ardiente!

338
00:28:58,862 --> 00:29:00,405
[Stefano] Don't worry, Governor.

339
00:29:00,864 --> 00:29:03,450
You'll still be protected by the Triad.

340
00:29:03,783 --> 00:29:05,910
-I trust you, Stefano.
-[chuckles]

341
00:29:05,994 --> 00:29:07,704
[suspenseful music]

342
00:29:07,787 --> 00:29:09,372
<i>This is it, Emilia.</i>

343
00:29:09,456 --> 00:29:12,083
<i>You have Papa's trust and love.</i>

344
00:29:12,417 --> 00:29:14,043
<i>Get going, big girl.</i>

345
00:29:14,127 --> 00:29:16,838
<i>Get ready for world domination.</i>

346
00:29:17,172 --> 00:29:20,091
[suspenseful music playing]

347
00:29:33,396 --> 00:29:35,940
<i>I'll be in control of the Triad soon.</i>

348
00:29:36,858 --> 00:29:41,196
<i>I'll finally get you back,</i>
<i>my sweet old town.</i>

349
00:29:41,988 --> 00:29:43,239
<i>Hang tight.</i>

350
00:29:44,115 --> 00:29:46,367
<i>Señor Julio is coming.</i>

351
00:29:51,289 --> 00:29:52,832
We're gonna have a big project tomorrow.

352
00:29:52,916 --> 00:29:53,875
-Excellent.
-Yes, we will.

353
00:29:53,958 --> 00:29:57,545
Okay? So, you better tell
your men and the boys. Be ready.

354
00:29:57,629 --> 00:29:58,546
-We will.
-We will be ready

355
00:29:58,630 --> 00:29:59,923
to take over the town.

356
00:30:00,006 --> 00:30:02,133
-Thank you. [chuckles]
-[man 1] Yeah, no problem.

357
00:30:02,217 --> 00:30:03,551
[man 1] As always.

358
00:30:05,386 --> 00:30:09,140
-[man speaking indistinctly]
-[Emilia chuckles]

359
00:30:13,520 --> 00:30:14,437
Good job.

360
00:30:14,521 --> 00:30:16,356
[tense music playing]

361
00:30:19,734 --> 00:30:24,697
You know, every time
I say that, someone dies.

362
00:30:25,114 --> 00:30:26,074
[chuckles]

363
00:30:26,991 --> 00:30:28,034
[exhales]

364
00:30:29,410 --> 00:30:31,496
No one dared to defy me.

365
00:30:32,872 --> 00:30:34,123
They all loved me.

366
00:30:34,749 --> 00:30:36,459
They even called me their friend.

367
00:30:38,086 --> 00:30:38,962
You know…

368
00:30:40,755 --> 00:30:42,090
I could still be the governor

369
00:30:42,173 --> 00:30:44,884
if Papa didn't tell me to step down.

370
00:30:46,302 --> 00:30:47,679
But you're still here.

371
00:30:50,557 --> 00:30:51,891
Not as a governor…

372
00:30:54,269 --> 00:30:56,354
but one of the leaders

373
00:30:56,437 --> 00:31:01,276
of the most powerful organization in Asia.

374
00:31:01,359 --> 00:31:02,402
[chuckles]

375
00:31:02,944 --> 00:31:04,988
[suspenseful music playing]

376
00:31:20,044 --> 00:31:22,881
[suspenseful music continues]

377
00:31:29,762 --> 00:31:31,055
[Emilia chuckles]

378
00:31:39,856 --> 00:31:43,026
[tense music playing]

379
00:31:44,193 --> 00:31:45,236
[chuckles]

380
00:31:46,237 --> 00:31:47,864
[tense music playing]

381
00:31:53,953 --> 00:31:54,996
[Stefano] Come in.

382
00:32:01,336 --> 00:32:02,670
I prepared…

383
00:32:04,088 --> 00:32:05,256
something for you.

384
00:32:05,757 --> 00:32:07,759
[tense music playing]

385
00:32:16,059 --> 00:32:18,061
[chuckles] Wait. Wait. Wait.

386
00:32:19,562 --> 00:32:21,064
I'll have to take a shower.

387
00:32:23,024 --> 00:32:24,025
Perfect.

388
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:26,527
[tense music playing]

389
00:32:30,782 --> 00:32:31,824
I'll be waiting here.

390
00:32:33,451 --> 00:32:35,161
-Okay.
-Make it quick.

391
00:32:35,620 --> 00:32:36,746
[chuckles]

392
00:32:41,626 --> 00:32:43,836
Very quick. [chuckles]

393
00:32:47,423 --> 00:32:48,466
[door closes]

394
00:32:49,634 --> 00:32:52,178
[suspenseful music playing]

395
00:33:07,944 --> 00:33:10,655
Stefano, we need to talk.

396
00:33:14,701 --> 00:33:15,994
Stefano, wait.

397
00:33:16,077 --> 00:33:18,162
[suspenseful music playing]

398
00:33:29,257 --> 00:33:32,093
We have nothing to talk about, Julio.

399
00:33:32,176 --> 00:33:34,012
It has been decided.

400
00:33:34,095 --> 00:33:35,471
How dare you!

401
00:33:37,056 --> 00:33:39,267
You know what I want to talk about.

402
00:33:39,350 --> 00:33:41,060
You know what I want.

403
00:33:41,144 --> 00:33:43,896
[tense music building]

404
00:33:44,772 --> 00:33:46,065
What's happening here?

405
00:33:51,279 --> 00:33:52,363
Indulge me.

406
00:33:54,323 --> 00:33:55,324
What?

407
00:33:55,825 --> 00:33:57,910
You are going to shoot me?

408
00:33:57,994 --> 00:34:00,747
You think you can beat me, huh?

409
00:34:00,830 --> 00:34:05,334
Just because you're supposed
to be a member of the Triad?

410
00:34:06,961 --> 00:34:09,172
No one beats me,

411
00:34:09,797 --> 00:34:13,092
especially an amateur like you.

412
00:34:14,385 --> 00:34:15,386
You know what?

413
00:34:15,470 --> 00:34:17,847
Everyone who goes against me ends up dead.

414
00:34:18,806 --> 00:34:21,184
And I think I will add your head

415
00:34:22,018 --> 00:34:24,312
to the chain of other heads
that I already have.

416
00:34:24,395 --> 00:34:29,650
And I will use you as décor
for my front porch.

417
00:34:30,818 --> 00:34:32,278
[laughs]

418
00:34:36,616 --> 00:34:38,201
You talk too much

419
00:34:39,702 --> 00:34:41,079
for someone so powerless.

420
00:34:41,954 --> 00:34:43,164
[Stefano laughs]

421
00:34:49,003 --> 00:34:50,713
Reality check.

422
00:34:50,797 --> 00:34:52,757
The Triad

423
00:34:53,925 --> 00:34:55,510
<i>is under Emilia now.</i>

424
00:34:56,427 --> 00:34:58,387
<i>And one more thing,</i>

425
00:34:58,471 --> 00:35:00,056
ex-governor.

426
00:35:01,557 --> 00:35:02,850
You're powerless,

427
00:35:03,392 --> 00:35:05,686
and you can't do anything about it.

428
00:35:05,770 --> 00:35:07,897
You are nothing but dirt

429
00:35:07,980 --> 00:35:11,567
under the sole of your own daughter.

430
00:35:12,360 --> 00:35:13,611
[laughs]

431
00:35:14,320 --> 00:35:17,031
[tense music playing]

432
00:35:20,952 --> 00:35:22,328
[laughs]

433
00:35:25,081 --> 00:35:26,207
[chuckles]

434
00:35:27,125 --> 00:35:32,255
[both laugh]

435
00:35:33,214 --> 00:35:34,590
[laughs]

436
00:35:37,218 --> 00:35:38,177
Boys.

437
00:35:39,262 --> 00:35:40,596
[cane clatters]

438
00:35:40,680 --> 00:35:43,141
[tense music playing]

439
00:35:47,937 --> 00:35:49,897
[chuckles]

440
00:35:49,981 --> 00:35:52,733
[suspenseful music playing]

441
00:35:57,071 --> 00:35:58,114
[Julio] What?

442
00:35:58,197 --> 00:36:01,701
Surprise, surprise.

443
00:36:02,410 --> 00:36:06,956
So, you think I am dirt, huh?

444
00:36:07,039 --> 00:36:09,000
Me?! Dirt?!

445
00:36:10,001 --> 00:36:15,840
Emilia is nothing but a stupid weakling.

446
00:36:16,549 --> 00:36:17,842
She actually thinks

447
00:36:18,926 --> 00:36:21,304
<i>that I'm impressed and proud of her.</i>

448
00:36:22,263 --> 00:36:25,266
<i>Well, it's not surprising.</i>

449
00:36:25,892 --> 00:36:27,351
She takes after her mother.

450
00:36:28,060 --> 00:36:30,688
They're no different from each other.

451
00:36:31,564 --> 00:36:33,941
They're both stupid.

452
00:36:35,234 --> 00:36:38,487
<i>Five million each for your allegiance.</i>

453
00:36:39,238 --> 00:36:41,616
[suspenseful music playing]

454
00:36:56,714 --> 00:36:59,008
[sobbing]

455
00:37:12,688 --> 00:37:18,986
Not again, Papa. Not again. [sobbing]

456
00:37:21,364 --> 00:37:24,533
[wailing] I thought you believed
in me this time!

457
00:37:27,203 --> 00:37:29,038
[wailing]

458
00:37:34,627 --> 00:37:35,670
You know…

459
00:37:36,796 --> 00:37:40,716
It was quick thinking on my part

460
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:44,470
when I put a bomb
in Helena's little ambulance.

461
00:37:45,930 --> 00:37:47,014
[Julio] <i>Bomb.</i>

462
00:37:48,641 --> 00:37:50,601
Boom! [chuckles]

463
00:37:51,310 --> 00:37:52,853
And instantly…

464
00:37:54,855 --> 00:37:56,857
she was dead.

465
00:37:57,566 --> 00:37:59,944
And no one ever knew that I did it.

466
00:38:00,945 --> 00:38:06,325
<i>Now, wasn't that brilliant of me, huh?</i>

467
00:38:08,828 --> 00:38:10,037
Yes!

468
00:38:11,539 --> 00:38:16,961
I am the fire that engulfed…

469
00:38:17,753 --> 00:38:21,882
your precious Red Dragon.

470
00:38:23,009 --> 00:38:24,051
<i>Now…</i>

471
00:38:25,303 --> 00:38:26,595
<i>I want you to listen.</i>

472
00:38:26,679 --> 00:38:27,972
And listen well.

473
00:38:28,264 --> 00:38:32,560
I want this to ring out loud and clear.

474
00:38:34,312 --> 00:38:35,313
It was I.

475
00:38:36,022 --> 00:38:41,402
I killed Red Dragon.

476
00:38:41,485 --> 00:38:42,445
[laughs]

477
00:38:43,654 --> 00:38:48,534
[screams]

478
00:38:55,708 --> 00:38:59,086
Papa, how could you?! You monster!

479
00:39:00,004 --> 00:39:01,714
You bastard!

480
00:39:04,008 --> 00:39:09,638
-[suspenseful music playing]
-[boat engine revving]

481
00:39:16,395 --> 00:39:20,900
[suspenseful music playing]

482
00:39:36,874 --> 00:39:39,919
[suspenseful music playing]

483
00:40:02,691 --> 00:40:04,485
I murdered Helena.

484
00:40:04,568 --> 00:40:06,904
And if I could do that,

485
00:40:06,987 --> 00:40:10,950
I can kill my own daughter too,

486
00:40:11,033 --> 00:40:13,411
just to get what I want.

487
00:40:14,245 --> 00:40:15,371
<i>Which is…</i>

488
00:40:16,163 --> 00:40:18,040
<i>the Triad's power.</i>

489
00:40:18,624 --> 00:40:20,292
The Triad's money,

490
00:40:20,376 --> 00:40:22,545
the Triad's weapons,

491
00:40:22,628 --> 00:40:26,424
and the Triad's henchmen.

492
00:40:28,342 --> 00:40:31,804
And I am willing to go through anything

493
00:40:31,887 --> 00:40:34,932
to get my kingdom back.

494
00:40:35,808 --> 00:40:38,978
<i>At any cost, Stefano. At any cost.</i>

495
00:40:39,061 --> 00:40:41,939
[suspenseful music playing]

496
00:40:51,991 --> 00:40:52,908
[Arthur] <i>Lily…</i>

497
00:40:54,577 --> 00:40:56,078
<i>Here's what you asked for.</i>

498
00:40:58,330 --> 00:41:00,958
<i>The Triad has decided to work</i>
<i>with the Ardientes.</i>

499
00:41:01,250 --> 00:41:02,168
<i>And from what I heard,</i>

500
00:41:02,960 --> 00:41:05,629
<i>Emilia and Julio</i>
<i>will take over the syndicate.</i>

501
00:41:06,046 --> 00:41:07,590
<i>I know exactly how their minds work.</i>

502
00:41:08,215 --> 00:41:12,303
<i>They will get back at everyone.</i>

503
00:41:12,803 --> 00:41:14,972
<i>And, you're at the top</i>
<i>of their list, Lily.</i>

504
00:41:15,931 --> 00:41:18,184
[suspenseful music playing]

505
00:41:33,407 --> 00:41:37,119
[suspenseful music playing]

506
00:41:55,721 --> 00:41:56,764
[Jepoy] <i>You can't go in here.</i>

507
00:41:56,847 --> 00:41:58,432
[Natalie] <i>Why the hell not?! Huh?</i>

508
00:41:58,974 --> 00:42:00,142
<i>Let me in!</i>

509
00:42:01,393 --> 00:42:02,520
<i>Hi.</i>

510
00:42:02,603 --> 00:42:03,729
<i>Jepoy.</i>

511
00:42:04,188 --> 00:42:05,731
<i>Hello, Lily Cruz.</i>

512
00:42:05,814 --> 00:42:07,233
<i>Yes, it's me again.</i>

513
00:42:07,650 --> 00:42:09,985
<i>Okay. So, it looks like I barged into</i>

514
00:42:10,069 --> 00:42:12,655
<i>one of the greatest connivances ever.</i>

515
00:42:12,738 --> 00:42:15,950
<i>And I think I'll be joining you, guys.</i>

516
00:42:16,492 --> 00:42:19,286
<i>You found the Ardientes, didn't you?</i>

517
00:42:19,370 --> 00:42:21,121
<i>You found Julio and Emilia.</i>

518
00:42:21,205 --> 00:42:22,998
<i>Stay out of this, Natalie.</i>

519
00:42:23,082 --> 00:42:27,211
<i>You know, I would love</i>
<i>to do that, but I can't.</i>

520
00:42:27,461 --> 00:42:31,465
<i>I have to decide for both of us</i>
<i>and set aside our pride.</i>

521
00:42:31,549 --> 00:42:33,050
<i>We have the same enemies, Lily.</i>

522
00:42:33,133 --> 00:42:34,593
<i>It doesn't make sense for us</i>

523
00:42:34,677 --> 00:42:37,972
<i>to, like, not be in one team, right?</i>

524
00:42:38,055 --> 00:42:39,014
<i>You know what?</i>

525
00:42:39,098 --> 00:42:42,893
<i>It's either that</i>
<i>or I can sabotage your plan.</i>

526
00:42:42,977 --> 00:42:45,980
<i>And we both know that</i>
<i>you wouldn't want that, right?</i>

527
00:42:48,232 --> 00:42:49,191
[squeals]

528
00:42:49,942 --> 00:42:52,111
<i>I guess that's a yes. Silence means yes.</i>

529
00:42:52,570 --> 00:42:54,780
<i>So, yeah. I guess we're teammates now.</i>

530
00:42:54,863 --> 00:42:56,407
<i>Hi, teammate.</i>

531
00:42:57,491 --> 00:42:58,492
<i>Right?</i>

532
00:43:04,373 --> 00:43:05,583
<i>I'll leave you to it.</i>

533
00:43:08,544 --> 00:43:10,045
<i>I don't really have friends, you know?</i>

534
00:43:10,129 --> 00:43:13,382
<i>So, I think we all can be friends now.</i>

535
00:43:16,427 --> 00:43:17,428
[sighs]

536
00:43:21,849 --> 00:43:25,811
You know, I was planning to shoot you.

537
00:43:26,437 --> 00:43:27,646
But

538
00:43:27,730 --> 00:43:29,940
<i>I'll give you your life.</i>

539
00:43:30,024 --> 00:43:34,653
<i>Go back to your bosses in the Triad,</i>
<i>and explain to them</i>

540
00:43:34,737 --> 00:43:41,660
how you lost to a certain Julio Ardiente.

541
00:43:44,079 --> 00:43:45,873
[laughs]

542
00:43:49,543 --> 00:43:50,878
But on second thought…

543
00:43:50,961 --> 00:43:53,088
[gunshots]

544
00:43:53,172 --> 00:43:54,298
[yelps]

545
00:43:54,381 --> 00:43:56,342
[suspenseful music playing]

546
00:43:58,969 --> 00:44:00,387
[breathes deeply]

547
00:44:00,471 --> 00:44:02,264
I think you're better off dead.

548
00:44:02,681 --> 00:44:03,932
[grunts]

549
00:44:11,231 --> 00:44:14,193
[gunshots]

550
00:44:14,276 --> 00:44:15,402
-[Jepoy grunts]
-[woman gasps]

551
00:44:15,486 --> 00:44:16,779
[water splashes]

552
00:44:17,363 --> 00:44:18,447
[gunshot]

553
00:44:18,822 --> 00:44:19,865
[grunts]

554
00:44:20,532 --> 00:44:22,576
[grunts, pants]

555
00:44:23,786 --> 00:44:26,830
-[gunshot]
-[water splashes]

556
00:44:26,914 --> 00:44:31,335
-[gunshots]
-[water splashes]

557
00:44:34,046 --> 00:44:35,631
[gunshots]

558
00:44:35,714 --> 00:44:36,924
<i>Go! Go! Go!</i>

559
00:44:38,342 --> 00:44:39,385
[gunshots]

560
00:44:41,345 --> 00:44:43,138
[Lily] <i>Where do you think</i>
<i>you're going, Julio Ardiente?!</i>

561
00:44:43,222 --> 00:44:45,641
<i>I won't let you ruin any more lives again.</i>

562
00:44:45,724 --> 00:44:48,602
<i>The question is, are you willing to kill?</i>

563
00:44:48,686 --> 00:44:49,853
[screams]

564
00:44:49,937 --> 00:44:54,233
<i>You have an immaculate heart.</i>
<i>You want to be a hero.</i>

565
00:44:54,316 --> 00:44:55,859
<i>That's why you can't push yourself</i>

566
00:44:55,943 --> 00:44:58,529
<i>to soil your hands with blood.</i>

567
00:44:58,987 --> 00:44:59,988
[gunshot]

568
00:45:00,447 --> 00:45:01,740
<i>I am no hero.</i>

569
00:45:01,824 --> 00:45:04,201
<i>That's why I can kill you.</i>

570
00:45:05,661 --> 00:45:08,580
[theme music playing]
